        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Ithihasa\n- People: Aneesh Lee Ashok, Binu S., Deepak Dev, Deepak Devraj Komath\n- Topics: Malayalam cinema\n\nFacts:\n- Ithihasa is a 2014 Malayalam fantasy comedy film.\n- Aneesh Lee Ashok wrote Ithihasa.\n- Binu S. directed Ithihasa.\n- Deepak Devraj Komath is better known as Deepak Dev.\n- Deepak Dev is an Indian music composer best known for his work in Malayalam cinema.\n- Deepak Dev composed music for Malayalam films including Chronic Bachelor, Udayananu Tharam, Naran, Puthiya Mukham, Urumi, Grandmaster, and Bhaskar the Rascal.",
